Process (static)

Process spawning and inter-process communication.

Methods:
  Spawn(name, code)           - Create new process from code string
  Spawn(name, path)           - Create new process from file path
  Get(guid)                   - Get process by GUID
  Send(process, message)      - Send message to specific process
  Send(message)               - Broadcast message to all processes
  Execute(code)               - Execute code synchronously, returns (success, output)
  List()                      - List all process IDs
  Await(pid)                  - Block until process completes

Properties:
  Messages                    - Queue of received messages
  Processes                   - List of all subprocesses
  Self                        - Current process reference